f members of in-groups better than those of out-groups.
\par Experiment. Red task\emdash hard (logic problems, 45min), green task\emdash easy (photo hunt, 10min). }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \ul\insrsid8925841\charrsid8925841 Condition 1}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid8925841\charrsid8925841 
