s own transgressions. That is, although individuals might have negative automatic reactions to both their own and others\rquote  transgressions, they may engage in more consciously m
otivated reasoning when judging their own transgressions in order to maintain a positive self-view.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \ul\insrsid8925841\charrsid8925841 Experiment}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid8925841\charrsid8925841 . High load introduced to disturb a System 2 process. The rest as in Valdesolo, DeSteno, }{\rtlch\fcs1 
